# Hiveton H5000M (MT7987A) — U-Boot environment, for fw_printenv / fw_setenv.
#
# Bootloader : Yuzhii0718/bl-mt798x-dhcpd, U-Boot 2025.07.1-Mediatek
#              (lives in the "fip" GPT partition; sysupgrade never touches it).
# Storage    : the 512 KiB "u-boot-env" GPT partition, /dev/mmcblk0p1.
#
# env_size is the WHOLE partition (0x80000), not a smaller slab.  Measured, not
# guessed: CRC32 over exactly bytes 4..0x80000 of a partition dump equals the
# value stored in bytes 0..4 (0xa27037a6); every smaller size fails the check.
# Confirmed on the running device with `fw_printenv -c <file>`, which printed
# all 23 vendor variables and no "Bad CRC" warning.
#
# uboot-envtools on this image ships fw_printenv/fw_setenv only — it has no
# /etc/init.d/ubootenv and no board config, so nothing overwrites this file.
#
# Columns: <device> <offset> <env_size> <sector_size> <num_sectors>
/dev/mmcblk0p1	0x0	0x80000	0x200	0x400
